BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (cases [luVb2J9MsQk @ 00:00:06]. In the Brandi mass tort lane, each injured person still gets an individual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (lawsuit, but cases from around the state go into the same courtroom for efficiency because they share) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (information that must be disclosed in each case [luVb2J9MsQk @ 00:00:25].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (The second point of agreement is that serious injury and death claims do not belong in a class. Newman) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (uses Roundup and non-Hodgkin lymphoma as the test: each plaintiff must prove that their own cancer was) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (caused by Roundup exposure, a host of plaintiff-specific considerations that one representative cannot carry) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (for everyone [Kez8eHItKyc @ 00:01:02]. Roberts states the general rule the same way - personal injury and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (wrongful death cases are poor class candidates because each person's harm or loss is different, so an MDL) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (is 'generally the better way to go' after a serious injury or the loss of a loved one [XubmYzsLJEw @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (00:01:03]. Jim Adler, the Texas Hammer, adds the variance argument: in drug and device cases every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (plaintiff was injured by the same product, yet it hit people differently based on luck, health or other) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (differences; with Zantac, not everyone developed cancer and those who did may have different types) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm ([zQ_r4HK402Y @ 00:01:55]. Adler also flags a structural tell - every class action plaintiff must be in a similar) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (situation, while a mass tort does not require that. Legal Case Info runs paraquat and Parkinson's, prenatal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (Tylenol and autism risk, and Roundup cancer claims through the same filter and lands on mass tort because) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (each injury is unique [GTVP4u5_otQ @ 00:01:10].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (Where the class action wins, the practitioners agree on the profile: small, uniform, mostly monetary harm.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (Brandi's math is the cleanest pitch - a million people overcharged three dollars on a phone bill will never sue) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (individually, yet that conduct netted the phone company three million dollars, and the class action is the tool) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.47 Tm (that 'calls that type of conduct into check' as one lawsuit in which the class is the plaintiff [luVb2J9MsQk @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.25 Tm (00:01:26]. Larry Taylor Jr. of the Cochran Firm Texas points to the notice-in-the-mail model - the ABC cell) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 244.02 Tm (phone company letter telling recipients to fill out a form - as the class action signature, built to recoup money) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.80 Tm (from corporate wrongdoing, while mass torts are harm-based injury cases [hSl_yaMfnv0 @ 00:00:38].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 213.57 Tm (Business Box lays out the participation flip: mass torts require plaintiffs to opt in by filing their own lawsuits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 198.35 Tm (with their own attorney, while class members are automatically included unless they opt out, so most never) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 183.12 Tm (take an active step [ET5Xa_RCeM8 @ 00:01:51]. Damages follow the same split; Business Box says class) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 167.90 Tm (damages are typically distributed equally, with every data breach customer possibly receiving the same) Tj ET
