BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 653.77 Tm (The most expensive failure is paying for leads that intake then wastes. Saad Khan cites one firm that burned) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 638.55 Tm ($24,000 in payroll processing 800 rejected leads, the exact cost the auto-reject screening is built to kill) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 623.32 Tm ([ZkN7hMCBwmQ @ 00:00:15]. Alert Communications puts numbers on the conversion gap: firms with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 608.10 Tm (broken intake convert 20% to 40% of leads instead of 70% to 80% [PJEVefyQCxA @ 00:16:47]. Alert's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 592.87 Tm (worked example runs a $2,000 cost per acquisition built from $500 to $1,750 of marketing and $250 to $500) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 577.65 Tm (of intake, with a single lost lead costing up to $750 [PJEVefyQCxA @ 00:17:17]. The trap that hides this is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 562.42 Tm (an undersized funnel: a firm reporting 70 out of 100 looks healthy while the leads it never captured stay) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 547.20 Tm (invisible, against an Alert campaign running at 70% qualified that can reach 80% to 85% [PJEVefyQCxA @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 531.97 Tm (00:14:18]. K'Lee Terrazas adds the paid-media version of the same loss: another attorney's $30,000 in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 516.75 Tm (Facebook ads was a 100% loss [lW3uPdauQrA @ 00:13:28]. Andrew Picket's fix is procedural, not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 501.52 Tm (budgetary: record every call, honoring two-party consent where it applies, and check intake before spending) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 486.30 Tm (another dollar on marketing [lW3uPdauQrA @ 00:29:07].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 471.07 Tm (The phone itself is where leads bleed out. Alert Communications measured abandonment rising after three) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 455.85 Tm (rings and again after a 15-second hold, and reported one firm running six-minute holds [PJEVefyQCxA @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 440.62 Tm (00:19:14]. The overflow sequence Alert prescribes is three rings, a recorded message, a 15-second hold,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 425.40 Tm (then roll to the overflow center [PJEVefyQCxA @ 00:21:02]. Alert also found voicemail or no answer on 35%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 410.17 Tm (of calls, and flags paralegals juggling intake alongside other work as a weak point [PJEVefyQCxA @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 394.95 Tm (00:28:06]. Repeat-attempt data shows why one dial is never enough: immediate calls reach 37% to 40%,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 379.72 Tm (and varying call times lifts contact to 75% to 80% [PJEVefyQCxA @ 00:35:45]. K'Lee Terrazas cites a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 364.50 Tm (Google report that 28% of GBP calls were missed on the first attempt [XcpDdsuGoEY @ 00:03:27], and is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 349.27 Tm (blunt about what happens next: those callers are not going to leave a voicemail [j80F3HgdRAw @ 00:03:15].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 334.05 Tm (Terrazas built Intake EQ after watching a $500 click that could have been a million-dollar case get lost) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 318.82 Tm ([lW3uPdauQrA @ 00:30:22]. Even the AI fix shows seams: in the live demo, the agent Kim misnamed the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 303.60 Tm (caller Kaitlin versus Caitlyn while running the eleven-question PI screen.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 288.37 Tm (Some failures sit downstream of the phone. Modern Legal Ops watched volume roughly double from 2024 to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 273.15 Tm (2026 with a single intake agent, Lisa, while conversion lagged because three to four hidden steps sat) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 257.92 Tm (between open and close [jycz9TsdE9w @ 00:00:00]. After splitting the pipeline into open, working, under) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 242.70 Tm (review, and retainer response, and timing each stage, the culprit turned out to be internal attorney workup,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 227.47 Tm (not intake [jycz9TsdE9w @ 00:01:16]. Litify's trainer flags quieter CRM traps: a list-view search only covers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 212.25 Tm (that filtered list, so staff can miss intakes that exist elsewhere [5eCAkl3wUBg @ 00:11:34], and stacking too) Tj ET
