BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 151.35 Tm (connecting with after exhausting every other channel, until Kayse reached 20% to 30% of them and brought) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 136.12 Tm (them back to get paid through settlements [kjUaKK45Ahg @ 00:01:00]. Alert adds that screeners never sit) Tj ET
