BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Step: 3) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Title: Run The Lens, Then Validate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Action: Push records through litigation-specific screening and have firm staff validate the output.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (Detail: Pattern's intake screening covers product usage, exposure timelines, diagnosis and diagnostic) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (evidentiary weight in real time and same day, with firm staff validating [Pattern Data - PjzhkF1x4xI @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (00:01:41]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (Step: 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (Title: Route To Liens And Disbursement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (Action: Hand clean, exportable claimant data to the lien resolver and settlement administrator.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (Detail: Goldberg says command of data and exportable, searchable systems decide how fast a firm moves) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (through programs that can run first-in-first-out [Jon and Marc - 8CBO3CgHLvA @ 00:23:20]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (The retrieval playbook from The New York Injury & Malpractice Law Firm runs on speed, not patience.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (Portals are fast but incomplete, and the statutory 30-day deadline is almost always ignored, so the firm calls) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (the records custodian directly, cites ongoing medical care, and asks for email delivery or sends a courier at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (a set time, chasing a 24-hour turnaround with follow-up calls [uJITvDxd4jA @ 00:01:48]. When a provider) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (stonewalls with a $5,000 quote, the move is to narrow the request to the operative or imaging report, roughly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (10 to 20 pages instead of 2,000 to 3,000, and if that fails, subpoena the records, since ignoring a subpoena) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (means contempt; the firm has sued just to get records [uJITvDxd4jA @ 00:03:40]. The firm's no-expense) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (routine adds a three-page cover letter citing HITECH that refuses to pay for paper, then a walk-in at Albany) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (Medical Center with a HIPAA power of attorney to pick up a CD the next day, often at no charge, and a $10) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (Starbucks gift card, then scans the file into case-management software and burns CDs for experts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm ([JdDeicrkI-o @ 00:02:35]. Bernard Nomberg flags one carve-out: X-ray films can carry a charge, so get a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (quote first because a third-party vendor may be involved [_9ZPWIgPW14 @ 00:03:36].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (On the review side, Matt Francis builds one lens per litigation at Pattern Data and runs three products off it:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (same-day screening on usage, exposure timelines, diagnosis and evidentiary weight; development work on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (treatment patterns, severity, risk factors and gaps; and settlement packaging with eligibility, points or matrix) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (valuation, and proof packets for a neutral or claims administrator [_HuCGlH6Wyw @ 00:06:16]. Valuation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (turns on dosage, duration, latency and cancer-subtype dividing lines, and Francis reliably sees 7 to 10x) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (better throughput on case review, which matters when settlements land with 60, 90 or 120-day windows for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (thousands of clients [_HuCGlH6Wyw @ 00:13:03]. At Tor Herman Law, a NICU child's file ran 43,000) Tj ET
